OL,3,ANandy rejects claims of politicising
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday after Erasmus row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat sparked a backlash from the
OL,7,FConservatives, who said "veterans did
OL,8,Fnot fight for a student exchange
OL,9,Fscheme" and accused her of making an
OL,10,F"EU membership pitch".
OL,12,FNandy said she was "horrified" by the
OL,13,FTory response and insisted that the
OL,14,Fexpanded EU scheme for study and work
OL,15,Fwould help young Britons recognise
OL,16,Fwartime sacrifice.
